<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6542] SocketChannel may not be closed in createTcpClient()</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6542</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There&apos;s no finally() on ch in TcpCommunicationSpi.createTcpClient()&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So there&apos;s a long block of code where resource consistency is hanging on a hair. This can lead to file descriptor starvation as well.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13106437">IGNITE-6542</key>
